description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests a custom sensitive-data detector
  configuration (Rust-compatible regex, context words, proximity, masking) for a specific
  data type such as ID numbers, account numbers, PII, PHI, PCI, credentials, or API
  keys, built from a format description or refined from an existing regex for fewer
  false positives. Examples: "build a custom data pattern for our patient IDs", "add
  context words to this regex". Do not activate for regex help unrelated to sensitive-data
  classification, questions about built-in detectors, or deployment/testing of detectors
  and non-data threats such as malware or network intrusions.'
